      <description><![CDATA[<h3>AutoPaper 0.1.2</h3>
<ul>
<li><b>Match my appearance:</b> wallpapers now suit your Mac's light or dark mode (on by default; Settings → General). Your keywords still come first.</li>
<li>A native Moods list with a Use / In Use button.</li>
<li>The Dock and menu bring AutoPaper's windows to the front.</li>
</ul>]]></description>
